font-bold underline\">Learn More</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-t-4 border-purple-500 service-card\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-3\">Electric Geysers</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Standard household units. Comprehensive <b>electric geyser repair vadodara</b> for all electrical faults.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/geyser-technician-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Learn More</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Detailed technical content to reach 3500 words -->\n        <section class=\"mb-16\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Comprehensive <b>Geyser Maintenance Service Vadodara</b></h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                Regular upkeep is the backbone of any appliance&#8217;s longevity. When it comes to <b>geyser maintenance service vadodara</b>, Atlas Aircon employs a systematic approach to ensure your system runs at peak efficiency. Our <b>geyser technician vadodara</b> begins with a thorough inspection of the internal tank. Over time, the hard water prevalent in many parts of Gujarat leads to massive scale buildup. This calcium carbonate layer acts as an insulator, forcing your <b>geyser heating element issue vadodara</b> to become more frequent as the coil struggles to heat the water through the crust.\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                Our <b>professional geyser repair vadodara</b> service includes chemical descaling that dissolves these deposits without damaging the tank&#8217;s inner lining. We also prioritize the <b>geyser anode rod replacement vadodara</b>. Many homeowners are unaware that this rod is designed to corrode so that your tank doesn&#8217;t. If ignored, the tank will eventually leak, necessitating a <b>geyser leaking repair vadodara</b> or even a full unit replacement.\n            </p>\n    